c17ae725e\n\n\n### System information\n\nPixel 4\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen running an Android project using the single click deploy, it gets stuck on the boot splash. Inspecting with adb shows the following spam printing:\n```\nERROR: Scene path was specified on the command line, but this Godot binary was compiled without support for path overrides. Aborting. \nTo be able to use it, use the `disable_path_overrides=no` SCons option when compiling Godot.\n```\n\nAppears to be a regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Export any Android Project with default settings\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[android-export-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23519861/android-export-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112715/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112715/timeline","performed_v